    "demoquest": {
      "html": "<h1>Demographic Information<\/h1>\n<h5>Questions based on Garrett BL, Scurich N, Crozier WE (2020). Mock jurors' evaluation of firearm examiner testimony.\nLaw and Human Behavior, 44(5): 412-423.<\/h5>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n  <label class=\"control-label\" id=\"uniqueID-label\" for=\"uniqueID\">Unique ID<\/label>\n  <input id=\"uniqueID\" type=\"text\" class=\"shiny-input-text form-control\" value=\"\"/>\n<\/div>\n<br/>\n<div id=\"race\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-checkboxgroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"race-label\">\n  <label class=\"control-label\" id=\"race-label\" for=\"race\">Please specify your race or ethnicity (select all that apply):<\/label>\n  <div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n    <div class=\"checkbox\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"race\" value=\"White\"/>\n        <span>White<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"checkbox\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"race\" value=\"Black or African American\"/>\n        <span>Black or African American<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"checkbox\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"race\" value=\"American Indian or Alaska Native\"/>\n        <span>American Indian or Alaska Native<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"checkbox\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"race\" value=\"Asian\"/>\n        <span>Asian<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"checkbox\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"race\" value=\"Native Hawaiian or Pacific Islander\"/>\n        <span>Native Hawaiian or Pacific Islander<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"checkbox\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"race\" value=\"Hispanic\"/>\n        <span>Hispanic<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"checkbox\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"race\" value=\"Other\"/>\n        <span>Other<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br/>\n<div id=\"gender\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"gender-label\">\n  <label class=\"control-label\" id=\"gender-label\" for=\"gender\">Please specify your gender:<\/label>\n  <div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"Man\"/>\n        <span>Man<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"Woman\"/>\n        <span>Woman<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gender\" value=\"Other/non-binary\"/>\n        <span>Other/non-binary<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br/>\n<div id=\"age\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"age-label\">\n  <label class=\"control-label\" id=\"age-label\" for=\"age\">Please specify your age:<\/label>\n  <div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"age\" value=\"18 - 25\"/>\n        <span>18 - 25<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"age\" value=\"26 - 35\"/>\n        <span>26 - 35<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"age\" value=\"36 - 45\"/>\n        <span>36 - 45<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"age\" value=\"46 - 55\"/>\n        <span>46 - 55<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"age\" value=\"56 - 65\"/>\n        <span>56 - 65<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"age\" value=\"Over 65\"/>\n        <span>Over 65<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br/>\n<div id=\"income\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"income-label\">\n  <label class=\"control-label\" id=\"income-label\" for=\"income\">Please specify your total family income before taxes:<\/label>\n  <div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"Less than $10,000\"/>\n        <span>Less than $10,000<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$10,000 - $19,999\"/>\n        <span>$10,000 - $19,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$20,000 - $29,999\"/>\n        <span>$20,000 - $29,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$30,000 - $39,999\"/>\n        <span>$30,000 - $39,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$40,000 - $49,999\"/>\n        <span>$40,000 - $49,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$50,000 - $59,999\"/>\n        <span>$50,000 - $59,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$60,000 - $69,999\"/>\n        <span>$60,000 - $69,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$70,000 - $79,999\"/>\n        <span>$70,000 - $79,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$80,000 - $89,999\"/>\n        <span>$80,000 - $89,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$90,000 - $99,999\"/>\n        <span>$90,000 - $99,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"$100,000 - $149,999\"/>\n        <span>$100,000 - $149,999<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"income\" value=\"More than $150,000\"/>\n        <span>More than $150,000<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br/>\n<div id=\"gunown\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"gunown-label\">\n  <label class=\"control-label\" id=\"gunown-label\" for=\"gunown\">Do you own a firearm?<\/label>\n  <div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gunown\" value=\"Yes\"/>\n        <span>Yes<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"gunown\" value=\"No\"/>\n        <span>No<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br/>\n<div id=\"guncomfort\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-radiogroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-labelledby=\"guncomfort-label\">\n  <label class=\"control-label\" id=\"guncomfort-label\" for=\"guncomfort\">How comfortable are you with firearms?<\/label>\n  <div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"guncomfort\" value=\"Extremely Comfortable\"/>\n        <span>Extremely Comfortable<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"guncomfort\" value=\"Moderately Comfortable\"/>\n        <span>Moderately Comfortable<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"guncomfort\" value=\"Slightly Comfortable\"/>\n        <span>Slightly Comfortable<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"guncomfort\" value=\"Neither Comfortable nor Uncomfortable\"/>\n        <span>Neither Comfortable nor Uncomfortable<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"guncomfort\" value=\"Slightly Uncomfortable\"/>\n        <span>Slightly Uncomfortable<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"guncomfort\" value=\"Moderately Uncomfortable\"/>\n        <span>Moderately Uncomfortable<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"radio\">\n      <label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"guncomfort\" value=\"Extremely Uncomfortable\"/>\n        <span>Extremely Uncomfortable<\/span>\n      <\/label>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br/>",
